<title>LATVIA: C.BANK DEPO RATE STABLE AT 1.5 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>C.BANK DEPO RATE STABLE AT 1.5 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvia's central bank said on Monday that it would accept deposits for 31 days at an unchanged rate of 1.5 percent on June 9.</p>
<p>The bank said in a statement that the payment date for the deposits would be July 10.</p>
<p>The rate for 31-day deposits has remained unchanged since it was cut from 2.0 percent on May 5.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
